themes.txt is a copy of Termoil's crates/termoil-app/themes/themes.txt, taken at Termoil commit d0dba6a
(task-2597). One theme per line:
name|foreground|background|cursor|selection background|selection foreground|the sixteen ANSI colors.

Termoil converted the color schemes from https://github.com/mbadolato/iTerm2-Color-Schemes at commit
3d8a6a1a983d7fe721aa6cb9a5b98066cd74303a (MIT license, see LICENSE). Termoil Dark and Termoil Light are
written by the Termoil authors, and Unluminous Dark, Unluminous Light, Islands Dracula Colorful, Material
Palenight, Material Deep Ocean, Monokai Pro and One Dark are the themes Unluminous ships.

A theme added or fixed in Termoil is copied here, the way sprite.rs is.
